  "description": "Pure-managed SIMD H.264 baseline-profile encoder for real-time streaming. No native dependencies; NEON, AVX2 and SSSE3 accelerated.",
  "id": "Proxeno.Kiln",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-08-25T20:17:54.95Z",
